VW provides a wide array of tools for processing images, ranging from
simple thresholding and convolution operators up to complete algorithms
such as Canny edge detection and Harris/Plessey corner detection. All
the classes and functions described are included by
using
@example
   #include <VW/improc.h>
@end example
or more usually, one can include just the desired algorithm, eg
@example
   #include <VW/Improc/subsample.h>
@end example


